# Read by Cloudflare Pages when the site is deployed. It is not served as a page.
#
# Tells search engines to leave the admin page out of their results. This is said here, in the
# reply itself, because a search engine that does not run the app never sees what the page adds
# for itself (hideFromSearch in src/lib/web-page.ts). The page is deliberately not named in
# robots.txt: that would stop a search engine reading this, and would point people at it.
/admin
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/admin/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
